{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JHN",
  "chapter": 13,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now before the feast of the passover, when Jesus knew that his hour was come that he should depart out of this world to the Father, having loved his own who were in the world, he loved them to the end.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And supper being ended (the devil having now put into the heart of Judas Iscariot, Simon's ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "son",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", to betray him;)",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus knowing that the Father had given all things into his hands, and that he had come from God, and was going to God;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He riseth from supper, and laid aside his garments; and took a towel, and girded himself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "After that, he poured water into a basin, and began to wash the disciples feet, and to wipe ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with the towel with which he was girded.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then he cometh to Simon Peter: and Peter saith to him, Lord, dost thou wash my feet?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered and said to him, What I do thou knowest not now; but thou shalt know hereafter.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Peter saith to him, Thou shalt never wash my feet. Jesus answered him, If I wash thee not, thou hast no part with me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Simon Peter saith to him, Lord, not my feet only, but also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hands and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " head.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus saith to him, He that is washed needeth not save to wash ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " feet, but is wholly clean: and ye are clean, but not all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he knew who would betray him; therefore said he, Ye are not all clean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So after he had washed their feet, and had taken his garments, and was set down again, he said to them, Know ye what I have done to you?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye call me Master, and Lord: and ye say well; for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I am.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I then, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "your",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Lord and Master, have washed your feet; ye also ought to wash one another's feet.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I have given you an example, that ye should do as I have done to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Verily, verily, I say to you, The servant is not greater than his lord; neither he that is sent greater than he that sent him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ye know these things, happy are ye if ye do them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I speak not of you all; I know whom I have chosen: but that the scripture may be fulfilled, He that eateth bread with me, hath lifted up his heel against me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now I tell you before it cometh, that when it hath come to pass, ye may believe that I am ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Verily, verily, I say to you, He that receiveth whomsoever I send, receiveth me; and he that receiveth me, receiveth him that sent me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When Jesus had thus said, he was troubled in spirit, and testified, and said, Verily, verily, I say to you, that one of you will betray me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the disciples looked one on another, doubting of whom he spoke.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now there was leaning on Jesus' bosom, one of his disciples, whom Jesus loved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Simon Peter therefore beckoned to him, to ask who it should be of whom he spoke.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He then lying on Jesus' breast, saith to him, Lord, who is it?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered, He it is to whom I shall give a sop, when I have dipped ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ". And when he had dipped the sop, he gave ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to Judas Iscariot, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the son",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of Simon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And after the sop Satan entered into him. Then said Jesus to him, What thou doest, do quickly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now no man at the table knew for what intent he spoke this to him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For some ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thought, because Judas had the bag, that Jesus had said to him, Buy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "those things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that we have need of against the feast; or, that he should give something to the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He then having received the sop, went immediately out: and it was night.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore when he had gone out, Jesus said, Now is the Son of man glorified, and God is glorified in him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If God is glorified in him, God will also glorify him in himself, and will immediately glorify him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Little children, yet a little while I am with you. Ye will seek me: and, as I said to the Jews, Whither I go, ye cannot come; so now I say to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A new commandment I give to you, That ye love one another; as I have loved you, that ye also love one another.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By this shall all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " know that ye are my disciples, if ye have love one to another.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Simon Peter said to him, Lord, whither goest thou? Jesus answered him, Whither I go, thou canst not follow me now; but thou shalt follow me afterward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Peter said to him, Lord, why cannot I follow thee now? I will lay down my life for thy sake.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.13.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.13.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered him, Wilt thou lay down thy life for my sake? Verily, verily, I say to thee, The cock will not crow, till thou hast denied me thrice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
